                            <div class="text-[0.72rem] font-semibold mt-1 text-slate-500">Equipping youngsters to compete internationally</div>
                            <div class="text-[0.72rem] mt-2 text-slate-500">0783841141 / 0785638463</div>
                            <div class="text-[0.72rem] text-slate-500">cliftonmataruse2@gmail.com</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-right text-[0.8rem] leading-tight font-semibold text-slate-800">
